    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Identity*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Reptilians are **purpose-built constructs** created to serve as the muscle of the Anunnaki occupation.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "creation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ],
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To the Anunnaki, they are **\"perfect servants\"** and \"biological engineering\" successes; to the Igigi, they are the unyielding guards of their prison.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They represent the **weaponized transformation** of Earth’s own biological history into an instrument of its subjugation.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Nature*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Standing **nine feet tall** on reverse-articulated legs, they are enhanced biological entities with scales that shift color for camouflage and claws capable of **rending stone**.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They are distinguished by vertical-slit eyes that see across **multiple wavelengths** and a bone-crowned skull protecting a specialized cranial cavity.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unlike the Igigi, their consciousness is intentionally limited to prevent \"troublesome self-awareness,\" making them narratively irreplaceable as the **absolute enforcers** of the Anunnaki will.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Drives*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their drives are purely functional and **genetically mandated**: they want to fulfill directives and maintain the security of Anunnaki sites.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They are motivated by **programmed instincts** for coordination and combat, lacking the complex emotional or mathematical drives of other sentient species.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Limits*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Reptilians are strictly limited by their **simple cognitive capacity**; they cannot calculate probability matrices or perform sophisticated \"consciousness-touch\" like the Igigi or Anunnaki.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They are bound by a **total lack of autonomy**, as their neural pathways are engineered to open without resistance to Overseer commands.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They cannot act outside of their programmed **combat and security protocols**.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
