            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They represent the terrifying potential of technology to strip a biological form of its \"personhood,\" turning it into a **living machine** that enforces the will of its creators against its own world.",
