      "text": "The Reptilians are like **biological guard dogs** whose DNA has been rewritten to understand military tactics; they do not care about the ethics of the property they guard or the history of the land they walk on—they only know the \"scent\" of their master’s command and the \"target\" they have been trained to bite.",
